<body><div class="app">
<aside>
  <h1>Learning Law with GenAI</h1>
  <p>Content-rich interactive lesson with checkpoint quizzes and 10-question final quiz.</p>
  <div class="progress-wrap"><div class="progress-bar" id="progressBar"></div></div>
