      <tr><td>AI drafts practice answers.</td><td>You see a polished answer.</td><td>You do not practice writing under exam conditions.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>AI checks every step immediately.</td><td>You feel less uncertain.</td><td>You lose productive struggle and independent confidence.</td></tr>
